{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_082710","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"今天天气很好。我换上泳装，躺在甲板上的躺椅上时，Strangelove走了过来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"明明这么热，她却还是一如既往地穿着长袖长裤。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"我朝她挥手，她嘟囔着“这、这么巧啊”，然后移开了视线。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"我问她有什么事，她的视线却像舔舐一样，从我身上慢慢扫过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"接着，她咽了口唾沫，说：“皮肤真漂亮啊……。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我有些困惑，只能摇头说：“哪有。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我知道有传言说她喜欢女人……难道她是在打我的主意？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"她盯着我说：“不，很漂亮的皮肤。不过晒得太多可不好。”说着还握住了我的手。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"我想用“晒黑一点又没什么……”结束话题，她却激烈地摇头。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"“那可不行。不行！女孩子一定要好好保护皮肤！”她不知为何显得异常兴奋。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"照她的说法，日晒会让皮肤老化，产生色斑和雀斑，最严重时甚至会导致皮肤癌。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"我当然知道日晒会长雀斑，不过一直以为那只是肤色较浅的盎格鲁-撒克逊人才需要担心的问题。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":127,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"可被一个女科学家郑重地告诉“日晒会让皮肤老化”，我突然也开始害怕了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"为了维持十几岁少女的设定，也许我确实得更注意皮肤。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"见我有些为难，她从口袋里拿出一支小管，说那是自己常用的防晒霜。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"她说送给我，让我拿去用。我一时有些不知所措。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"能收到当然很高兴，可她到底有什么企图？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"只是单纯的好意？还是说，她果然在打我的主意？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"不过，好像也没必要拒绝。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"我也接受过一定程度的训练。真出了什么事，要保护自己不受这个缺乏运动的女科学家摆布，轻而易举。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":138,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"只要有力量，就没什么可怕的。就像拥有核武器的国家，可以在与他国交涉时占据优势一样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"我老老实实道了谢，决定收下。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"谁知她说要帮我涂，挤了些防晒霜在手指上，直接按到了我的胸口。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"事情来得太突然，我惊得连反抗都忘了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"她白皙纤细的手指抚过我的腹部，又一路滑进比基尼胸罩包裹出的乳沟之间。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"“诶？等、等等……”我慌了起来，她却用湿润的双眼凝视着我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"好美……。面对这个比我大十多岁的女人，我不知为何竟看得入了迷。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"她在我耳边低声说“别动”，我只能默默点头。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"身体一下子失去了力气，像被迷住一样动弹不得。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"她就这样仔仔细细地把防晒霜涂遍了我的全身。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"我明明没有那种嗜好，却一时大意，竟然有些陶醉了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"那个女人果然很危险……以后得小心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""}]}